  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/76f815ff-80e4-43a0-bf80-c65cbfc02644-9895086.PNG\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 130px;\" /></p><p>As electric field is uniform, so force acting on the charged particle will be uniform.</p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mover><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mJ</mi></math></p>",
